# Keep the build context small and never bake local state, secrets or build output into an image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.vite
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.tsbuildinfo
apps/web/gallery-screenshots

.git
.github
.claude
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

docs
design-reference
e2e
examples
tooling
*.md
!README.md
